.TH start-cli-volumes-remove 1  "remove "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-volumes\-remove \- Remove a shared volume; deletes the data of a local volume
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli volumes remove\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR>
